  "goodToKnow": "Die Erkennung is recognition or detection: die Gesichtserkennung (facial recognition), die Spracherkennung (speech recognition), die Früherkennung (early detection, of diseases). German statutory health insurance covers Früherkennungsuntersuchungen (screening check-ups). Police use of automatic facial recognition is controversial under German data protection rules. Erkennen means to recognise. Plural: die Erkennungen."
